<H2>Notices</H2>

<UL>

<LI>From: Sean Butler (sean@comp.lancs.ac.uk)<BR>
If you want to tell the WWW Caving community anything then this is a
mechanism <em>you</em> could use.

<LI>From: Michael Dollenger(<A HREF="mailto:dollengm@gusun.georgetown.edu">dollengm@gusun.georgetown.edu</A>)<BR>
Wahey,
Yeah, it's been a while. This is a rare event; me actually being
in the G-Town computer lab, and I've got a class soon, so 
I'm basically throwing this message out to see if anybody I 
know actually sees it.
   I noticed you've got a packed trip schedule this year:
outstanding! I hope the new membership drive went well. I 
don't know to what extent, if any, I'll be able to support Tresviso 
96 this summer, but I'm still interested in hearing the details: when is it going
and what the current team roster looks like, etc. 
   Anyway, any who knows me please respond to this inquiry
a short acknowlwedgement that you've seen it and I'll make
an addittional effort to respond to it.

- Mike 

