<H2>Events</H2>
<UL>
<LI>The LUSS <A HREF="triplist.html">trip list</A> is available.

<LI>From: Philip Walker(<A HREF="mailto:p.r.walker@lancaster.ac.uk">p.r.walker@lancaster.ac.uk</A>)<BR>
20th to 23rd June 1996 Leave Thursday 5.00pm at South Wales : There are only a few places left for the weekend trip to 
South Wales.  We will be camping at the SWCC HQ in the Black
Mountains and intend to go down the following caves;  OFD, 
DYO, Llethrid, Pant Mawr and LNRC.  Any LUSS members who are
interested should come to Lonsdale Bar at 8.00pm on Tuesday
to book a place.

The cost will be £25, which includes transport down and 
camping.  You will need to bring your own food and camping 
equipment.

More details can be obtained from the Tuesday meetings.
<!-- Events -->

</UL>
